{
    "title": "Grubhub: Food Delivery",
    "description": "When in doubt, go for takeout\u2014Grubhub has it all! Order food delivery from thousands of restaurants, including local spots and national chains, and get groceries delivered too. Prefer pickup? No problem. Know the fees upfront and track orders from Grubhub delivery partners in real time\u2014the only surprise is just how easy takeout can be. \r\n\r\n<b>ORDER FROM THOUSANDS OF RESTAURANTS</b>\r\nWith Grubhub, you can order takeout from your favorite local restaurants and everyone\u2019s favorite chains. There are so many good eats out there, but you obviously deserve the best. Grubhub makes it easier to choose your next meal with restaurant ratings and reviews. French fries, pizza, burritos, burgers, sushi, donuts\u2014it\u2019s all here, whenever a craving strikes. \r\n\r\n<b>GET GROCERIES DELIVERED TOO</b>\r\nThink beyond your breakfast, lunch, and dinner orders. Grubhub offers the ultimate convenience with grocery delivery, in addition to restaurant takeout. Order milk, bread, snacks, and frozen foods, as well as household essentials like paper towels and laundry detergent, from local convenience stores.  \r\n\r\n<b>EXPECT TO SEE THE FEES UPFRONT</b>\r\nGrubhub gives it to you straight. See the delivery fee upfront, before you start crafting the perfect food order. Pay your way with credit cards, Grubhub gift cards, or Venmo.\r\n\r\n<b>SKIP DELIVERY FEES</b>\r\nThe key is Grubhub+. Sign up for unlimited $0 delivery fees on eligible orders, and enjoy exclusive offers and rewards as a Grubhub+ member.* Try Grubhub+ free for 30 days, then level up for just $9.99/month. The truth is, food tastes even better when you spend less on delivery. See details below.\r\n\r\n<b>TRACK DELIVERY IN REAL TIME</b>\r\nGrubhub puts your delivery on the map. Track eligible orders in real time, from the restaurant to your front door, and know the moment your bacon-egg-and-cheese arrives. Every delivery is a special delivery with Grubhub.\r\n\r\n<b>COUNT ON THE GRUBHUB GUARANTEE</b>\r\nGet your food delivered on time and at the lowest price. Guaranteed, or we\u2019ll make it right. See details: grubhub.com/guarantee\r\n\r\n<b>YOU DO YOU AND GRUBHUB DELIVERS</b>\r\nGrubhub serves up a personalized app experience, so you can reorder that feast you\u2019re still thinking about from two months ago. Order sauce on the side, go for extra pickles, lose the onions\u2014Grubhub gets you. Are you a regular? Get rewarded when you come back for more at the same restaurants. You can also plan ahead by pre-ordering food for pickup or delivery. \r\n\r\n<b>ORDER FROM NATIONAL RESTAURANTS</b>\r\nSometimes you need a sure thing, and that\u2019s why Grubhub partners with national restaurants to offer the takeout food you know and love. Get delivery from Applebee\u2019s, Arby\u2019s, Buffalo Wild Wings, Burger King, Chick-fil-A, Chipotle, Denny\u2019s, Dunkin\u2019, Five Guys, IHOP, McDonald\u2019s, KFC, Panda Express, Panera, Papa John\u2019s, Popeyes, Shake Shack, Subway, Taco Bell, Wendy\u2019s, White Castle, and more.\r\n\r\n<b>GET SUPPORT WHEN YOU NEED IT</b>\r\nBurning questions? Delivery crisis? Grubhub customer support is here for you 24/7. \r\n\r\n*$0 delivery fees only apply to eligible delivery orders from Grubhub+ merchants that meet the subtotal minimum (before tax, tip, and fees) on the applicable menu page or otherwise indicated on the Grubhub platform. Additional fees may apply. 5% pickup credit applicable on eligible future pickup orders only and is calculated based on the qualifying order subtotal. Credit is not transferable, not redeemable for cash, expires 90 days after most recent credit is issued and is subject to restrictions. Grubhub+ is an automatically renewing membership service requiring recurring payments. <b>After your free trial ends, your free trial will convert to a paid Grubhub+ membership and Grubhub will automatically charge you each month at the then-current rate (currently $9.99) plus tax until you cancel.</b> See terms: https://lp.grubhub.com/legal/plus/",
    "descriptionHTML": "When in doubt, go for takeout\u2014Grubhub has it all! Order food delivery from thousands of restaurants, including local spots and national chains, and get groceries delivered too. Prefer pickup? No problem. Know the fees upfront and track orders from Grubhub delivery partners in real time\u2014the only surprise is just how easy takeout can be. <br><br><b>ORDER FROM THOUSANDS OF RESTAURANTS</b><br>With Grubhub, you can order takeout from your favorite local restaurants and everyone\u2019s favorite chains. There are so many good eats out there, but you obviously deserve the best. Grubhub makes it easier to choose your next meal with restaurant ratings and reviews. French fries, pizza, burritos, burgers, sushi, donuts\u2014it\u2019s all here, whenever a craving strikes. <br><br><b>GET GROCERIES DELIVERED TOO</b><br>Think beyond your breakfast, lunch, and dinner orders. Grubhub offers the ultimate convenience with grocery delivery, in addition to restaurant takeout. Order milk, bread, snacks, and frozen foods, as well as household essentials like paper towels and laundry detergent, from local convenience stores.  <br><br><b>EXPECT TO SEE THE FEES UPFRONT</b><br>Grubhub gives it to you straight. See the delivery fee upfront, before you start crafting the perfect food order. Pay your way with credit cards, Grubhub gift cards, or Venmo.<br><br><b>SKIP DELIVERY FEES</b><br>The key is Grubhub+. Sign up for unlimited $0 delivery fees on eligible orders, and enjoy exclusive offers and rewards as a Grubhub+ member.* Try Grubhub+ free for 30 days, then level up for just $9.99/month. The truth is, food tastes even better when you spend less on delivery. See details below.<br><br><b>TRACK DELIVERY IN REAL TIME</b><br>Grubhub puts your delivery on the map. Track eligible orders in real time, from the restaurant to your front door, and know the moment your bacon-egg-and-cheese arrives. Every delivery is a special delivery with Grubhub.<br><br><b>COUNT ON THE GRUBHUB GUARANTEE</b><br>Get your food delivered on time and at the lowest price. Guaranteed, or we\u2019ll make it right. See details: grubhub.com/guarantee<br><br><b>YOU DO YOU AND GRUBHUB DELIVERS</b><br>Grubhub serves up a personalized app experience, so you can reorder that feast you\u2019re still thinking about from two months ago. Order sauce on the side, go for extra pickles, lose the onions\u2014Grubhub gets you. Are you a regular? Get rewarded when you come back for more at the same restaurants. You can also plan ahead by pre-ordering food for pickup or delivery. <br><br><b>ORDER FROM NATIONAL RESTAURANTS</b><br>Sometimes you need a sure thing, and that\u2019s why Grubhub partners with national restaurants to offer the takeout food you know and love. Get delivery from Applebee\u2019s, Arby\u2019s, Buffalo Wild Wings, Burger King, Chick-fil-A, Chipotle, Denny\u2019s, Dunkin\u2019, Five Guys, IHOP, McDonald\u2019s, KFC, Panda Express, Panera, Papa John\u2019s, Popeyes, Shake Shack, Subway, Taco Bell, Wendy\u2019s, White Castle, and more.<br><br><b>GET SUPPORT WHEN YOU NEED IT</b><br>Burning questions? Delivery crisis? Grubhub customer support is here for you 24/7. <br><br>*$0 delivery fees only apply to eligible delivery orders from Grubhub+ merchants that meet the subtotal minimum (before tax, tip, and fees) on the applicable menu page or otherwise indicated on the Grubhub platform. Additional fees may apply. 5% pickup credit applicable on eligible future pickup orders only and is calculated based on the qualifying order subtotal. Credit is not transferable, not redeemable for cash, expires 90 days after most recent credit is issued and is subject to restrictions. Grubhub+ is an automatically renewing membership service requiring recurring payments. <b>After your free trial ends, your free trial will convert to a paid Grubhub+ membership and Grubhub will automatically charge you each month at the then-current rate (currently $9.99) plus tax until you cancel.</b> See terms: https://lp.grubhub.com/legal/plus/",
